===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A heavy or helpless collapse; a slouching or drooping [[posture]]; a period of poor activity or performance, especially an [[extended]] period.
# {{context|Scotland|UK|dialect|lang=en}} A [[boggy]] place.
# {{context|Scotland|lang=en}} The noise made by anything falling into a hole, or into a soft, miry place.
# {{context|Scotland|lang=en}} The [[gross]] [[amount]]; the [[mass]]; the [[lump]].

